abstract: "A Claude Code agent and structured knowledge base for developing Education Informatics (Bildungsinformatik) as a discipline: literature database with DOI-verified APA/BibTeX, a citable wiki organised by the six criteria of disciplinarity, and skills for papers, discussion and project proposals."
